    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to this beautifully presented 3 bedroom, 3 bathroom house at 7 Ard Na Glaise.\n\nLocated in the highly desirable Ard Na Glaise development just off Stillorgan Park Road in South Dublin. Finished to an excellent standard with contemporary design and light filled living spaces throughout, this property offers modern family living in a serene yet connected neighbourhood.\n\nUpon entering the property, you are welcomed by a bright hallway. To the left is a spacious living room, furnished with a large comfortable sofa and filled with natural light from the front window, creating a warm and inviting space to relax. The entrace hall leads into an open plan kitchen and dining area flooded with natural light and offer views out over the landscaped garden. \n\nThe modern kitchen is a bright and well designed space, featuring a central island that provides additional workspace and seating, making it ideal for casual dining and entertaining. The kitchen offers ample storage and generous countertop space throughout. Adjacent to the kitchen is a separate utility room, providing extra storage and laundry facilities while keeping the main living area clutter free. This practical layout enhances everyday living and adds to the overall functionality of the home.\n\nA stylishly decorated guest WC is located off the hallway on the ground floor, finished to a high standard and adding both convenience and a touch of elegance to the home.\n\nUpstairs, the first floor features three well-proportioned bedrooms. The master bedroom benefits from its own en-suite bathroom, providing privacy and comfort, while the remaining two bedrooms are served by a main family bathroom\n\nThe main bathroom is finished to a high standard, featuring contemporary tiling, modern sanitary ware, and a clean, elegant design. Bright and well laid out, it offers a comfortable and practical space for everyday use, complementing the modern finish found throughout the home.\n\nOutside, the property enjoys a private rear garden which is perfect for outdoor dining or simply relaxing in the sunshine. Off-street parking is provided for convenience.\n\nArd Na Glaise is located within walking distance of both Blackrock and Stillorgan villages offering a host of amenities including two shopping center, schools, local shops, bars and restaurants. There are various sports amenities in the locality, marine sports are a short drive away in Dun Laoghaire and there are number of coastal walks and parks. The M50 is within easy access and the N11 Quality Bus Corridor offers a variety of services with further transport options being the DART in Blackrock and the LUAS park and ride in Stillorgan."
      },
